{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lotographia.bsky.social/post/3ljtrsrvqlk2a", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:15+00:00", "content": "Proud as with @misswhanau.bsky.social and @geordierogers.co.nz 🏳️‍🌈✌️\n\nAt the Wellington Pride Parade", "content_hash": "fc1dd50488077175b8b0d3aef7c9e6c286a0673f4f9e6f99252ce0293c2d0a1e", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:spbngfi4oo7q6byokgfo3jxj/app.bsky.feed.post/3ljtrsrvqlk2a", "cid": "bafyreicnh4254chtd2dxgam3rkziuiouy3xnqxy5aaivw5xno2oemhhfie", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Councillor Geordie Rogers and mayor Tory Whanau of Wellington City posing in front of a pride parade", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:spbngfi4oo7q6byokgfo3jxj/bafkreibq6ahe2tb25jdaasrkdzwqvzgkcsdkoz6w7u6wczqluqpsgtiekm", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:spbngfi4oo7q6byokgfo3jxj/bafkreibq6ahe2tb25jdaasrkdzwqvzgkcsdkoz6w7u6wczqluqpsgtiekm"}], "original_created_at": "2025-03-08T05:23:46.602Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-03/3ljtrsrvqlk2a.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3ljtrsrvqlk2a", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/rebeccamatthews.bsky.social/post/3ljjqi4qhks23", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:15+00:00", "content": "Kia ora The Post - or there was that time I was described as “sanctimonious” and blamed for our water woes, for not granting every dollar asked for because I lacked confidence on Wellington Water’s ability to deliver, based on advice from our staff?", "content_hash": "fdbf8075d50b8c519acfce4f607e4785ff5daca68588a39eea5ec6b823df19ce", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:nzmxipots5hdjhm7j3embfj2/app.bsky.feed.post/3ljjqi4qhks23", "cid": "bafyreiag7aqgknkbx2by45icvznnrlpdh3xpckrk254x7bt7rqocuhg2ke", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:nzmxipots5hdjhm7j3embfj2/bafkreihnnb72dj4qdnwwoa3afscsfxu3ft43o6ghtsyo2juasao2uxvjau", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:nzmxipots5hdjhm7j3embfj2/bafkreihnnb72dj4qdnwwoa3afscsfxu3ft43o6ghtsyo2juasao2uxvjau"}], "original_created_at": "2025-03-04T05:33:17.753Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-03/3ljjqi4qhks23.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3ljjqi4qhks23", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz/post/3ljizigdhqc2y", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:15+00:00", "content": "It's important to note that Wellington Water has not released two independent reports. They have released two summaries, written by themselves, that provide their own view of the reports. Given this is all about transparency I have very little confidence we have the full picture", "content_hash": "11fedf37a936b3d1b87ed7d90246c945e6be4692c54dc9a15a1919e9b7faa234", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/app.bsky.feed.post/3ljizigdhqc2y", "cid": "bafyreifakuksihcmcphr4kwlks3ddqsyowf4lwc5ju2gr3t2sitjcpn54q", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-03-03T22:41:51.757Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-03/3ljizigdhqc2y.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3ljizigdhqc2y", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz/post/3ljggtqmct22t", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:15+00:00", "content": "Many of the findings in this report are the same as the findings in the independent report we commissioned months ago, which received an inadequate response from the organisation. Serious questions remain about why it took so long for WWL to start acting", "content_hash": "bbd8d5881c5f9cede152a142220e58832b75242db7060b9c5ab86b5d6fa588e1", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/app.bsky.feed.post/3ljggtqmct22t", "cid": "bafyreiff3zbmlitqif46dtlefaptvofvcy2kq2rq7gb67o6mxd6g4gn22q", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-03-02T22:02:48.866Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-03/3ljggtqmct22t.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3ljggtqmct22t", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
{"agency_id": "person-geordie-rogers", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz/post/3ljggtojdbc2t", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:24:15+00:00", "content": "After years of Councillors and staff raising concerns with Wellington Water, commissioning our own report, and being told by Mayors across the region we were overreacting it's good to see some errors being acknowledged but we still need to see some action www.rnz.co.nz/news/nationa...", "content_hash": "0b8459d9f79faf322bce5b4545dd3fbca59d9b7a4211598fdc3970fad0b09662", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6tjnjuyqrgmnfihpfdlww4m3/app.bsky.feed.post/3ljggtojdbc2t", "cid": "bafyreihtbhvg2373v2khpvmyrrjtysb5uftp2tmbawi5b3rkrolyw6ztyi", "source_id": "person-geordie-rogers-bluesky-41281444"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-03-02T22:02:48.865Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-03/3ljggtojdbc2t.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3ljggtojdbc2t", "source_account": "geordierogers.co.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/geordierogers.co.nz"}
